    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Midnight Village, an island where the night rules the skies, yet the folk live simple, cozy lives... but in a village where night rules the skies, are there any secrets to be discovered?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou walk the shoes of Kurosuke, newly moved in to Midnight Village.<br />\r\nTalk to the villagers of Midnight Village throughout the twelve days of midnight.<br />\r\nLearn the secrets of the villagers and befriend them throughout your journey.<br />\r\nExplore the island of the Midnight Village with it's lush forest.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat will you uncover? Perhaps stories of spies? Ghosts and demons? Or curses, even murder!?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhatever you find out, whatever happens, it's all a part of this story about the Midnight Village.",
